      "content": "thanks. i'm kinda worried about the hypoglycemia thing though. do you think i should maybe try a bit more than that to make sure it actually works? like if i took 10 or 15 units would that be safer to make sure my blood sugar actually comes down? i really just want this thirst to stop so i can sleep.",
